    {
      "id": "note-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 890,
      "width": 1088.64,
      "height": 120.0,
      "text": "Solid arrows show the logical evidence/model boundary, not packet order or a successful live query.\nParts 2 and 3 branch from Part 1. Part 4 combines them. Part 5 intentionally returns to the Part 1 sources.\nServices and seed data exist before the lab. Notebooks mainly create Search objects, not new Azure services.",
      "originalText": "Solid arrows show the logical evidence/model boundary, not packet order or a successful live query.\nParts 2 and 3 branch from Part 1. Part 4 combines them. Part 5 intentionally returns to the Part 1 sources.\nServices and seed data exist before the lab. Notebooks mainly create Search objects, not new Azure services.",
      "fontSize": 16,
